  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-errors:syntax-doctype\r\n\r\n> The parser sets the Document to quirks mode in this case\\.\r\n\r\nThis only happens in the initial insertion mode, though. Maybe this can be phrased in a different way to be more accurate (but also not more confusing).\r\n\r\n\"In the [initial insertion mode], the Document is set to quirks mode in this case.\"\r\n\r\n@inikulin ",
